      "n": "#17·37",
      "text": "This is an airy, beige linen cardigan with a relaxed fit and delicate ruffled edges. It drapes softly over your frame, adding warmth without bulk, and the natural weave of the fabric breathes well in the cool autumn air."
    },
    {
      "n": "#394·03",
      "text": "These are white sneakers with a perforated leather upper and a gum-colored sole. Their playful texture contrasts nicely with your sleek black blouse and jeans, giving you the comfort of sportswear without looking like an athletic outfit."
    },
    {
      "n": "#63·35",
      "text": "You have wide-leg jeans in a soft silvery wash that fall straight to the floor. They offer a clean, elongated line from your hip down to your ankle, which works beautifully with the volume of the cardigan above."
    },
    {
      "n": "#220·35",
      "text": "This is a simple golden chain necklace made of sturdy oval links. It rests comfortably against your collarbone, adding just enough metallic warmth to complement both the neutral tones and the black blouse underneath."
    },
    {
      "n": "#301·22",
      "text": "It is a smooth, milky beige leather tote with a relaxed structure. Its size is just right for carrying your essentials during a date, and its shape holds its form without looking stiff or oversized."
    }
  ]
